# The buttons (spec, Controls: Buttons), one expect a row, each through the Mac's way (UIState):
#   PLAY    play / stop, on the press
#   REC     the B part (fireBPart): its walk [5, 3, 0] from the next bar, degree 6 first
#   EDIT    re-roll every unlocked voice (rerollAllUnlocked: an undo point, then regenerate each one the mirror shows
#           unlocked, in voice order)
#   SEL     on the Voice page: the selected voice locked / unlocked (elsewhere, alone: nothing)
#   SAVE    the project to flash (stopped: at once)
#   OCT-    undo (the last undo point recalled at the next bar); none: said
#   OCT+    Dice (newSeed: an undo point, a fresh seed; playing, its state at the next bar)
#   OCT- with OCT+: neither (fm1-base's update mode, after 5 s)
#   HOME ENV ARP LFO SEQ FX GLO   the pages 0-6, the page's button lit
# The buttons act on their release (PLAY on its press), as AMB-1's; a voice key held at the press makes the combo.
proj template demo 0x5EED1234
# ---- the pages
tap ENV
expect view 1
tap ARP
expect view 2
tap LFO
expect view 3
expect btn_led3 1
expect btn_led6 0
tap SEQ
expect view 4
tap FX
expect view 5
tap GLO
expect view 6
tap HOME
expect view 0
expect btn_led6 1
expect btn_led3 0
# ---- SAVE stopped: written at once
expect store_writes 0
tap SAVE
expect store_writes 1
# ---- PLAY
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
wait 500
# ---- REC: the B part, from the next bar
expect degree 1
tap REC
wait 2700
expect degree 6
# ---- EDIT: Pluck 2 locked (on the Voice page with SEL), then every other voice re-rolled
tap ENV
turn SELECT 1
expect voice_sel 1
tap SEL
expect locked1 1
tap HOME
tap SEL
expect locked1 1
expect undo_depth 0
expect pat_hash_hi 0xabd25f74
tap EDIT
expect undo_depth 1
expect req0 2
expect req1 0
expect req2 2
wait 6000
expect gen0 2
expect gen1 1
expect gen2 2
# ---- OCT-: the re-roll undone at the next bar (the patterns as they were at EDIT)
expect pat_hash_hi 0x2e692ff0
tap OCT-
expect undo_depth 0
wait 2700
expect pat_hash_hi 0xabd25f74
# nothing left: said
expect warns 0
tap OCT-
expect warns 1
# ---- OCT+: Dice, an undo point, a fresh seed (from the clock and the pot: the simulator's are the test's)
expect seed_lo 0x5EED1234
expect pat_hash_hi 0xabd25f74
tap OCT+
expect undo_depth 1
expect seed_lo 0xe815d91a
# the new seed's patterns from the next bar: before its line the old ones still play
expect pat_hash_hi 0xabd25f74
wait 2700
expect pat_hash_hi 0x0f277af5
# ---- OCT- with OCT+: neither undoes nor dices
press OCT-
press OCT+
wait 300
release OCT+
release OCT-
expect undo_depth 1
expect seed_lo 0xe815d91a
# ---- PLAY again: stopped
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
